XlatStoreLo         ldd       ,s        offset low word
                    ldx       12,s      result node pointer
                    std       6,x       store low word
XlatDone            leas      8,s        free locals
                    puls      pc,u      return

IsFloatType         pshs      u         save the caller u register
                    ldd       #$FFC0    frame size for check
                    lbsr      stkcheck  check stack room
                    ldd       4,s       arg node type code
