UnaryStar           leax      MsgTooManyBrackets,pcr point to indirection message
                    pshs      x         push it
                    lbsr      BuildMsgBuf print trace
                    leas      2,s        drop arg
                    lbsr      ParseStatement2 advance to next token
UnaryStarLoop       ldd       GlbVar003F load current token
                    cmpd      #42       is it star
