UnaryJoinA          leas      -20,x     restore stack from saved X
UnaryEmitIndir      ldd       18,s      local arg
                    pshs      d         push it
                    ldd       14,s      selected code
                    pshs      d         push it
                    pshs      u         push node pointer
                    lbsr      CalcTypeSize build indirection node
                    leas      6,s        drop args
                    std       16,s      save result
                    ldd       6,s       result code
                    clra                clear high
                    andb      #$30      mask storage class bits
                    cmpd      #48       both set, do deref
                    lbeq      UnaryDeref skip conversion
                    ldd       GlbVar003F current token
                    cmpd      #120      token $78
                    bne       UnaryCheckConv no, other conversion
                    ldd       6,s       result code
                    pshs      d         push it
                    ldd       16,s      result value
                    pshs      d         push it
                    pshs      u         push node pointer
                    lbsr      ParseInitializer emit special node
UnaryPopArgs        leas      6,s        drop args
                    lbra      UnaryFixCode go fix code

UnaryCheckConv      ldd       16,s      result value
