                    lbsr      BuildMsgBuf print trace
                    leas      2,s        drop arg
                    ldd       #49       fallback type $31
                    std       ,u        store into node
                    ldd       #1        type one
                    std       6,s       store result code
UnaryCheckVoid      ldd       14,s      selected code
                    cmpd      #14       is code fourteen
                    bne       UnaryFinish no, finish emit
