                    std       14,s      store size
AssignLoop          leas      -6,s       allocate temp slots
                    ldd       16,s      load token
                    std       ,s        stash it
                    ldd       20,s      load node pointer
                    pshs      d         push node argument
                    leax      2,s       point to size argument
                    pshs      x         push it
                    leax      14,s      point to type argument
                    pshs      x         push it
